<title>POLAND: Polish NBP fixes zloty down vs dlr at 3.0120.</title>
<headline>Polish NBP fixes zloty down vs dlr at 3.0120.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland fixed the zloty at 3.0120 against the dollar, down from 3.0055 yesterday and at 1.8220 against the mark, up from 1.8355, the NBP said.</p>
<p>The NBP fixed the zloty at an average of 2.35 percent from the central weighted dollar and mark parity rates, up from Monday's 1.99 percent.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
